## Top 20 windows by FDR-corrected q

Window = (start, end) in Mb. `flagged` is the number of clusters that
independently flagged the window over the total cluster count. `q` is
the FDR-corrected Stouffer combined p-value; values below `1e-300`
are reported as `<1e-300`.

